    "PR description: \"GetFirstBlock requires every requested bit, so a partial match can reach its assertion. At genesis, the existing undo exception can reject an undo-only request or accept a request with missing block data. It also misses ranges containing only genesis.\"",
    "Commit 6f4519c466: \"When both endpoints are the same pruned block with only undo data, a request for block data and undo data now returns false before reaching the walker assertion.\""
